Package: kwin-effects-hdr-oled-saver
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, kwin-wayland (= ${kwin:Version})
Description: dims the Plasma panel brightness when idle to prevent OLED burn-in
 The effect dims the Plasma panel brightness while the user is idle,
 independently of the overall brightness settings. It works best in HDR
 mode.
 .
 Hovering, touching or clicking the panel restores full brightness
 instantly, unless configured to remain dimmed at all times. Panels on
 SDR displays can be excluded with the "Only affect HDR outputs" option,
 which is enabled by default.
 .
 Settings live in System Settings under Desktop Effects: minimum
 brightness, idle delay and dimming time.
